#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:5
#: 8e52ef15c5b34e0badd73a5b8594cf85
msgid "Building for Bebop on Linux"
msgstr "在 Linux 上为 Bebop 构建"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:7
#: b9321ad36f984466858598aec135056e
msgid ""
"These instructions clarify how to build ArduPilot for the `Bebop "
"<http://www.parrot.com/en/produits/bebop-drone/>`__ flight controller board "
"on a Linux machine. More details on the Bebop can be found :ref:`here "
"<copter:parrot-bebop-autopilot>`."
msgstr ""
"这些说明阐明了如何在 Linux 机器上为 `Bebop <http://www.parrot.com/en/produits/bebop-"
"drone/>`__ 飞控板构建 ArduPilot。有关 Bebop 的更多详情可在 :ref:`此处 <copter:parrot-bebop-"
"autopilot>` 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:15
#: 45b0cafff27c46529e776df0fb20ec7a
msgid ""
"The instructions for running ArduPilot on **Bebop 2** :ref:`can be found "
"here <building-for-bebop-2>`."
msgstr "在 **Bebop 2** 上运行 ArduPilot 的说明 :ref:`可在此处找到 <building-for-bebop-2>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:19
#: ed50ebe9453a4f2da5f78eea3f7f3739
msgid ""
"Making the changes described in this article will void your warranty! "
"Parrot's technical support will not help you with this hack or to recover "
"your original software."
msgstr "按照本文进行更改将使您的保修失效！Parrot 的技术支持不会帮助您解决此破解问题或恢复原始软件。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:26
#: b40ea7c411814f95a5299e14817941b6
msgid ""
"Hacking a commercial product is risky! This software is still evolving, and "
"you may well find issues with the vehicle ranging from poor flight to "
"complete software freeze."
msgstr "破解商业产品存在风险！此软件仍在持续演进，您可能会发现飞行器存在各种问题，从飞行性能差到软件完全冻结。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:30
#: d8ff0d869c3941bcbd538276d5786948
msgid ""
"That said, it is almost always possible to recover a drone and members of "
"the ardupilot dev team can likely help people hacking or recovering their "
"Bebop on `this google group <https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/bebop-"
"ardupilot>`__."
msgstr ""
"话虽如此，几乎总是可以恢复无人机，ArduPilot 开发团队成员可能会在 `此 Google 群组 "
"<https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/bebop-ardupilot>`__ 上帮助破解或恢复 Bebop "
"的人员。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:36
#: d164ca509b8b4ba5a16d4e047e005b9b
msgid "Upgrading the firmware"
msgstr "升级固件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:38
#: 8125fdd9b4d04677b908c717e74d2b8e
msgid ""
"As of Nov 2015, the Bebop ships with a version of Linux that cannot run "
"ArduPilot and must be upgraded. In order to upgrade it, you will need to "
"download a custom version `here <https://github.com/Parrot-"
"Developers/ardupilot/releases/download/bebop-v0.0/bebopdrone_update.plf>`__."
msgstr ""
"截至 2015 年 11 月，Bebop 出厂时搭载的 Linux 版本无法运行 ArduPilot，必须升级。要升级，您需要从 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/Parrot-"
"Developers/ardupilot/releases/download/bebop-v0.0/bebopdrone_update.plf>`__ "
"下载自定义版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:43
#: ec456f77477e47ddb3b9856113b4582c
msgid "In order to upgrade to this version:"
msgstr "升级到此版本的步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:45
#: cb72326ac33a40aea04b658cb988b54e
msgid "Power up your Bebop"
msgstr "为 Bebop 上电"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:46
#: 5a9a399de0ef4b3e9c2d8417566a1caa
msgid "Connect to its Wi-Fi network (BebopDrone-XXXX)"
msgstr "连接到其 Wi-Fi 网络（BebopDrone-XXXX）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:47
#: e3d661746344427db7cc90d9d990d136
msgid "Connect to it via ftp"
msgstr "通过 ftp 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:53
#: d4560188968e40bcbb7855bdbca3fad0
msgid "go to the eMMC directory"
msgstr "进入 eMMC 目录"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:59
#: 54209b034c1146f2822b8c365b183066
msgid "Upload the update file"
msgstr "上传更新文件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:65
#: daaedb50824c429e9aace225c214eb19
msgid "Connect to the Bebop by telnet"
msgstr "通过 telnet 连接到 Bebop"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:73
#: 0f5d124f27d44352be224174201d7834
msgid ""
"A telnet error here indicates the Bebop's current firmware does not have the"
" correct port open. Manually reboot the Bebop to complete the update."
msgstr "此处的 telnet 错误表明 Bebop 当前固件没有开放正确的端口。手动重启 Bebop 以完成更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:75
#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:271
#: 69ebba7d54164ed6b54808d058992637 e2a97327a1b645e2a51e4b0ed6c17c97
msgid "Sync and reboot"
msgstr "同步并重启"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:82
#: 2298876620ba474c93378a998936899c
msgid ""
"Wait for the Bebop to perform the update (this could take several minutes)"
msgstr "等待 Bebop 执行更新（这可能需要几分钟）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:87
#: ef6bcab60b6846f2803f3562f4696e19
msgid "Don't shutdown your Bebop during this time"
msgstr "此期间不要关闭 Bebop"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:89
#: fe20b731631f461c8549638e1d7abac0
msgid ""
"When the update is complete you can connect again via Wi-Fi and telnet and "
"verify the update by checking the software version indicates 0.0.0 (not an "
"official release)"
msgstr "更新完成后，您可以再次通过 Wi-Fi 和 telnet 连接，通过检查软件版本是否显示 0.0.0（非正式发布版）来验证更新"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:100
#: 690cdff8a80644f39b49ed90c2137b00
msgid "Build ArduCopter for Bebop"
msgstr "为 Bebop 构建 ArduCopter"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:104
