"linuxgnutools-2016.02-linaro_1.0.0-2_amd64.deb>`__"
msgstr ""
"安装 Parrot 版本的 linaro *arm-linux-gnueabihf* 工具链，可从 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/Parrot-Developers/toolchains/blob/master/parrot-tools-"
"linuxgnutools-2016.02-linaro_1.0.0-2_amd64.deb>`__ 下载"

