msgstr "下载并编译 ArduCopter"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:131
#: 9cd8d23a432c4e299a07802fd9387e5b
msgid "Clone ardupilot repository"
msgstr "克隆 ardupilot 仓库"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:138
#: e51ffb21438d4b8494779520dadccd67
msgid ""
"Building the flight control firmware is nearly identical for :ref:`building "
