#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:146
#: 6872732fa0614bce807b77f948fdfad0
msgid "Strip the binary to reduce the memory footprint:"
msgstr "精简二进制文件以减少内存占用："

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:153
#: d543720a2d1348df8430e750a19b1e86
msgid "Uploading the firmware"
msgstr "上传固件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:155
#: 111e3b5fe363429d87650be73d53a1f0
msgid ""
"If you haven't built the firmware as described in the previous steps you can"
" download a binary version `here <https://github.com/Parrot-"
"Developers/ardupilot/releases/download/bebop-v0.1/arducopter>`__"
msgstr ""
"如果您没有按照前面步骤构建固件，可以从 `此处 <https://github.com/Parrot-"
"Developers/ardupilot/releases/download/bebop-v0.1/arducopter>`__ 下载二进制版本"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:158
#: 0cf540b13352479abc5eff813c7e04f5
msgid "Connect again by ftp and go to the eMMC directory"
msgstr "再次通过 ftp 连接并进入 eMMC 目录"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:159
#: d6633f6ddcaf408eaa5aa12347029093
msgid "Put the arducopter binary"
msgstr "放入 arducopter 二进制文件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:165
#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:207
#: c599f658bf7b4eb0b2b49cd508e85e7e d43e2cd6f3b54c5f91609321d8878fe1
msgid "Connect to the Bebop via telnet"
msgstr "通过 telnet 连接到 Bebop"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:166
#: 188abcf384614eb38e471e0b9ca972af
