msgstr "启动 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:176
#: 0f8d1772603d4a31badca9bf53d8db99
msgid "Connect via telnet"
msgstr "通过 telnet 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:177
#: 99d66e6842014d92bf1bb97dcd662ae9
msgid "Kill the regular autopilot"
msgstr "终止常规飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:183
#: 4027cd0345b44def8e4d2d38e49b05bb
msgid "Launch Copter"
msgstr "启动 Copter"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:190
#: 8bd634ff0588404a81cd389fa000fc3d
msgid "Changing the GPS configuration"
msgstr "更改 GPS 配置"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:192
#: 0d0dfb0b312841d09608c09a13eb9f50
msgid ""
"In order to get Bebop's GPS to send the NMEA frames that APM's NMEA driver "
"understands, you need to change its configuration. To achieve this you will "
"need to stop the in-build autopilot as described previously (and don't "
"launch Copter yet):"
msgstr ""
"为了让 Bebop 的 GPS 发送 APM 的 NMEA 驱动程序能理解的 NMEA "
"帧，您需要更改其配置。为此，您需要如前所述停止内置飞控（但先不要启动 Copter）："

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:197
#: f95ddd3805e141e2b5258b1550eb494e
msgid ""
"Download the **gps_config** file `here <https://github.com/Parrot-"
"Developers/ardupilot/releases/download/bebop-v0.0/gps_config.txt>`__"
msgstr ""
"从 `此处 <https://github.com/Parrot-"
"Developers/ardupilot/releases/download/bebop-v0.0/gps_config.txt>`__ 下载 "
"**gps_config** 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:199
#: a48c3063847c411bb3aa585cfb0a2aa1
msgid ""
"Connect to the Bebop via ftp and go to the eMMC directory as indicated in "
"the \"Upgrading the firmware\" section above"
msgstr "如上面「升级固件」部分所述，通过 ftp 连接到 Bebop 并进入 eMMC 目录"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:201
#: 074c9839dfc04ce7955273aade7fcecb
msgid "Put the config file"
msgstr "放入配置文件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:208
#: 654841f5624e43efb419331b77505010
msgid "Copy **gps_config.txt** in /etc/"
msgstr "将 **gps_config.txt** 复制到 /etc/"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:214
#: b8c4b40c165b46ccaf411a533eb8ac88
msgid "Launch the GPS config updater"
msgstr "启动 GPS 配置更新程序"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:220
#: 672e29f39d034ff1ba0d82f6a09b86ad
msgid "Wait for NMEA messages to be displayed in the console"
msgstr "等待 NMEA 消息显示在控制台中"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:221
#: 9030903627524497aae9165a5e524ba1
msgid "Stop **libgps_cli** by typing **Ctrl-C**"
msgstr "按 **Ctrl-C** 停止 **libgps_cli**"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:224
#: a536eae04a364f37a1820ee582f47426
msgid "Launch Copter at startup"
msgstr "在启动时启动 Copter"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:226
#: 9e837742a8374bf7ac0aa4a20ba4c2ea
msgid ""
"It is a lot more convenient to automatically execute Copter startup than "
"connect and do this manually. In order to do so, the startup scripts need to"
" be hacked in the following way."
msgstr "自动执行 Copter 启动比每次手动连接操作方便得多。为此，需要以以下方式修改启动脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:232
#: 500bd755bdb3494dadda910bd5a8e950
msgid ""
"This part is critical since you have to edit the startup script. If you do "
"something wrong here, you could end up with a Bebop that can no longer boot "
"properly. If this happens you will have to get a UART cable to recover."
msgstr ""
"这部分至关重要，因为您需要编辑启动脚本。如果操作有误，可能导致 Bebop 无法正常启动。若发生这种情况，您将需要一根 UART 线缆来进行恢复。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:237
#: 8d79a4e72b5f4a55b762965608d19ede
msgid ""
"The startup script is located at **/etc/init.d/rcS**. You will need to edit "
"it to remove the lines launching the regular autopilot and replace them by "
"launching Copter. The line in question is the following:"
msgstr "启动脚本位于 **/etc/init.d/rcS**。您需要编辑它，删除启动常规飞控的行并替换为启动 Copter。相关行如下："

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:245
#: 3cd81eceb9ad47da94acbb6743b531a4
msgid "Replace this with:"
msgstr "将其替换为："

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:251
#: c8272116f57a483596664ec00d316ddd
msgid ""
"In order to avoid editing the file manually, download `this "
"<https://github.com/Parrot-"
"Developers/ardupilot/releases/download/bebop-v0.0/rcS>`__ rcS file."
msgstr ""
"为避免手动编辑文件，请下载 `此 <https://github.com/Parrot-"
"Developers/ardupilot/releases/download/bebop-v0.0/rcS>`__ rcS 文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:255
#: 14eb64f8071346c3a0e51cf825692fb7
msgid "Make a copy of the original rcS file for recovery purpose"
msgstr "备份原始 rcS 文件以便恢复"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:261
#: 89c86e328e71437fb3be56826078b78b
msgid ""
"Connect to the Bebop via ftp and put the rcS file in the eMMC as described "
"before for the other files."
msgstr "通过 ftp 连接到 Bebop，并如前面其他文件所述将 rcS 文件放入 eMMC。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:263
#: 03755c35b74d4e7ca017248a3bb282d3
msgid ""
"Then copy it manually to overwrite **/etc/init.d/rcS** and change "
"permissions"
msgstr "然后手动复制以覆盖 **/etc/init.d/rcS** 并修改权限"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:278
#: 95936aa84c9c4de2beaf710a6c813b20
msgid ""
"In case you want to put your Bebop back to normal and use the normal "
"autopilot and app again, just replace **/etc/init.d/rcS** with the backup "
"file, sync and reboot"
msgstr "如果您想让 Bebop 恢复正常并使用常规飞控和应用程序，只需将 **/etc/init.d/rcS** 替换为备份文件，同步并重启"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:290
#: 8eb4ad36920845078319747ceeef5de2
msgid ""
"If you put your software back to normal and use your Bebop with FreeFlight "
"smartphone App, you might be asked to upgrade your software version. If you "
"do so, you will have to repeat some of the previous steps, at least for the "
"GPS config, copying arducopter and modifying the init scripts. Regarding the"
" need to upgrade to a custom version, it will depend on whether some options"
" will or won't be available in the following release. Information to "
"follow..."
msgstr ""
"如果您将软件恢复正常并使用 FreeFlight 智能手机应用程序使用 "
"Bebop，可能会被要求升级软件版本。如果这样做，您需要重复部分前面的步骤，至少需要重做 GPS 配置、复制 arducopter "
"和修改初始化脚本。至于是否需要升级到自定义版本，将取决于以下版本中是否提供某些选项。后续信息请关注……"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:301
#: 52d63bec56c84710983f3681dc1a9177
msgid "Recovery"
msgstr "恢复"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:303
#: b0874341513e41b0afebb0246c471cc3
msgid ""
"In case something went wrong and you are not able to boot your Bebop anymore"
msgstr "如果出现问题导致 Bebop 无法启动"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:305
#: e047dc7e561c47cfaf20017e435bda16
msgid ""
"The UART port is located under the Bebop's neck on the right side (facing "
"the front camera)"
msgstr "UART 端口位于 Bebop 颈部下方右侧（面向前置摄像头）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:311
#: cf1f7d1e83ab44c2a16b783a101448fd
msgid ""
"You will have to pull back the polystyrene a bit but it shouldn't cause much"
" damage"
msgstr "您需要稍微拉开聚苯乙烯，但不应造成太大损坏"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:313
#: b7230adee3d5499b90dc518f0d2a3489
msgid ""
"Get a UART cable like `this one <http://www.digikey.com/product-"
"detail/en/TTL-232R-RPI/768-1204-ND/4382044>`__ or any FTDI 3 pin cable (GND "
"TXD RXD)"
msgstr ""
"准备一根如 `此款 <http://www.digikey.com/product-"
"detail/en/TTL-232R-RPI/768-1204-ND/4382044>`__ 或任意 FTDI 3 针线缆（GND TXD RXD）的 "
"UART 线缆"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-bebop-on-linux.rst:315
